01:04:01.879 --> 01:04:06.340
So I think we go forward. I think my understanding is that RAP

01:04:06.356 --> 01:04:08.731
tax dollars could go to any of this, yet there's other— Except for operation.

01:04:09.228 --> 01:04:12.614
Well, there's also additional restricted funds that we use as well.

01:04:12.695 --> 01:04:16.401
