01:06:32.787 --> 01:06:36.872
Like sponsorships? That would be decided.

01:06:37.818 --> 01:06:41.167
Remains to be seen. Can the city help with advertising for

01:06:41.667 --> 01:06:44.179
that, for the sponsorships? Are you talking about for benches?

01:06:44.227 --> 01:06:46.887
Sorry, Councilmember Wright.

01:06:47.608 --> 01:06:51.117
I think it could be just as simple as the process that

01:06:51.617 --> 01:06:54.787
