01:09:22.644 --> 01:09:26.121
in the community, we gotta make sure that we have that longevity

01:09:26.621 --> 01:09:28.870
in it built into it that we can replace it over a long-term period of

01:09:29.370 --> 01:09:32.719
time. So I just wanted to add that for the record. Thank you, Brad.

01:09:34.243 --> 01:09:37.469
