01:10:03.603 --> 01:10:07.064
threshold, right? Yep. And then you try to figure out how far you can make

01:10:07.564 --> 01:10:11.493
your dollar stretch and try to develop this park out. And some, some things just

01:10:11.993 --> 01:10:15.955
have to get cut when you're doing a price, when you're doing value evaluation

01:10:16.131 --> 01:10:19.855
engineering and you're doing it on the fly. Like, some things get cut and

01:10:20.355 --> 01:10:22.599
it's just part of the process. But I know that it seems small,

01:10:23.530 --> 01:10:26.339
