01:10:45.741 --> 01:10:48.970
continue to grow and perpetuate upon themselves where

01:10:49.051 --> 01:10:52.261
we can then, rather than an

01:10:52.761 --> 01:10:55.848
impact fee, those dollars begin to fund some of the replacement.

