01:15:04.894 --> 01:15:08.909
to meet those demands. That we see ourselves as being a partner with

01:15:08.942 --> 01:15:12.761
the state, working on economic development opportunities, working on transportation

01:15:13.261 --> 01:15:17.095
and water opportunities, and recognizing that if we

01:15:17.177 --> 01:15:20.456
are to continue to grow as a region, not just Eagle

01:15:20.956 --> 01:15:23.821
