02:07:21.432 --> 02:07:24.111
greatest amount of prosperity possible to the greatest amount of people.

02:07:24.880 --> 02:07:29.451
It's really our endeavor as a council. We dive

02:07:29.951 --> 02:07:32.078
into the details. We research. We struggle,

02:07:33.016 --> 02:07:35.465
