02:07:48.873 --> 02:07:52.464
a lot more time than I anticipated, and it's weightier

02:07:52.641 --> 02:07:56.175
than I anticipated. It's also very rewarding. It's also

02:07:56.675 --> 02:08:00.110
very challenging. Thank you. But it's weighty because

02:08:00.206 --> 02:08:03.257
we are trying to do something that has not been done. We are trying to

02:08:03.757 --> 02:08:06.613
create something that has not been created, and we're trying to elevate this city to

02:08:06.629 --> 02:08:09.439
a place that no one thought it could go.

02:08:10.659 --> 02:08:13.228
It's going to take a lot of energy and drive to do that. I can

02:08:13.728 --> 02:08:16.070
tell you that as what Councilmember Wright just said about our mayor,

02:08:17.146 --> 02:08:20.534
that it's true. Mayor Gray is leading from the front,

02:08:20.759 --> 02:08:24.482
