03:27:44.392 --> 03:27:47.700
Hypothetical 3, city council member has a 25% ownership interest in Company 2.

03:27:47.860 --> 03:27:50.670
Company 2 does business before the city council. Does City Council Member B have any

03:27:51.170 --> 03:27:54.171
obligations under state or city ethics laws? If so, what are those obligations?

03:27:56.917 --> 03:28:00.443
Yes, you have to disclose your ownership interest, right? And,

03:28:00.717 --> 03:28:04.420
uh, let's see, and then if that business

03:28:04.920 --> 03:28:08.946
comes before the council, then you need to recuse yourself and walk

03:28:09.027 --> 03:28:12.571
away and allow the council to deal with that outside

03:28:13.071 --> 03:28:17.063
of your presence. Yes, so you would have the written disclosure obligation to

03:28:17.322 --> 03:28:19.754
send something to the mayor,

03:28:20.143 --> 03:28:23.959
also would have a disclosure obligation in the meeting to disclose it immediately

03:28:24.459 --> 03:28:27.207
before consideration and recuse yourself. Okay.

03:28:27.515 --> 03:28:30.844
All right. So last part is standards for civil discourse.

03:28:31.638 --> 03:28:35.237
So this is in the city code. I think it relates to

03:28:35.302 --> 03:28:40.620
ethics in that obviously the way that we relate

03:28:41.120 --> 03:28:44.465
and talk to each other and the people who come and do business before the

03:28:44.965 --> 03:28:48.229
council, I think, has an ethical implication. And so we do have these standards for

03:28:48.245 --> 03:28:51.565
civil discourse. And state

03:28:52.065 --> 03:28:55.508
code basically says you should adopt them, and that's what that

03:28:56.008 --> 03:28:59.513
reference to state code is in here. But the

03:29:00.013 --> 03:29:03.585
purpose is, again, to meet our obligations to each other and to the public

03:29:03.894 --> 03:29:06.944
by following these. So let's talk about the standards.

03:29:08.630 --> 03:29:12.059
Conduct or language that is condescending, uncivil, abrasive, abusive, hostile,

03:29:12.075 --> 03:29:15.434
or obstructive impedes the fundamental goal of participating in civil discourse

03:29:15.627 --> 03:29:19.448
and public processes, and the rational, peaceful, and efficient resolution of

03:29:19.480 --> 03:29:23.157
decisions, and is a violation of this standard. Such conduct

03:29:23.657 --> 03:29:26.465
tends to delay and often to deny resolution of issues in the public interest.

03:29:26.545 --> 03:29:30.270
So that's something to keep in mind, is that when we are

03:29:30.335 --> 03:29:34.718
speaking to one another, sometimes discussions can get heated, or when an

03:29:35.218 --> 03:29:38.716
applicant comes and they have a proposal that

03:29:39.053 --> 03:29:42.492
sometimes discussions can get heated. It's always

03:29:42.524 --> 03:29:46.139
good to keep in mind to keep our conduct

03:29:46.639 --> 03:29:50.076
and our language within these bounds. So, you know,

03:29:51.185 --> 03:29:54.704
they may say something that you think is stupid or that doesn't make any

03:29:54.736 --> 03:29:58.400
sense. We still treat them with respect and

03:29:58.673 --> 03:30:02.015
we explain why we hold that position, not just say,

03:30:02.031 --> 03:30:05.968
hey, that's stupid. So. Elected and

03:30:06.468 --> 03:30:09.822
appointed officials and city employees should exhibit courtesy, candor, and cooperation in dealing with each

03:30:10.322 --> 03:30:14.271
other and the public and in the administration of the city. Elected officials,

03:30:14.319 --> 03:30:17.868
members of city boards and commissions, and employees shall not, without an adequate factual

03:30:18.368 --> 03:30:21.611
basis, attribute to other persons improper motives, purpose, or conduct.

03:30:22.381 --> 03:30:25.722
Each person affiliated with the city should avoid hostile, demeaning, or humiliating conduct and

03:30:26.222 --> 03:30:29.593
words in written and oral communications. Neither written submissions nor oral statements or

03:30:30.093 --> 03:30:33.238
conduct should disparage the integrity, intelligence, morals, ethics, or personal behavior of others. So,

03:30:34.046 --> 03:30:37.398
uh, pretty, uh, self-explanatory. And that

03:30:37.898 --> 03:30:39.136
is the end of the presentation. Are there any questions?

