Second. Okay, I got Council Member Wright with the motion and Council

03:55:02.276 --> 03:55:05.402
Member Clark with the second. All in favor? Aye.

03:55:06.380 --> 03:55:09.733
Nobody opposed? That passed unanimous, and we are adjourned at 10:22.

